### Key changes:

- **`#title` slot** — now holds the file name + add/open file links, always visible
- **`#actions` slot** — holds all action buttons (zoom, copy, edit, save, trello, diff stats), always visible in the header
- **`#summary` slot** — kept lean, only shows diff stats badge when collapsed
- **Default slot** — now contains **only** the code display area (`view-code`), run command button, and footer — this is the only part that collapses/expands
- All header button clicks use **`@click.stop`** to prevent toggling the collapsible when clicking action buttons

